dential skyscraper H. Rishabraj Phoenix, which redefines what it means to live in luxury. This 34-story architectural wonder, which is located in the center of Borivali, offers a variety of luxurious 3 BHK apartments, Jodi flats, and opulent penthouses/duplexes, all of which have private pools beginning on the 31st floor. Phoenix Borivali's innovative design makes sure that every residence offers expansive balconies with plenty of natural light and fresh air, as well as stunning panoramic views of the city.\n\nEach apartment's thoughtfully planned layout removes obstacles, and the no-beam design maximizes natural ventilation and open space. The H.Rishabraj New Launch offers a chic, practical living space that complements any personality, with each corner showcasing the ideal harmony between modernity and elegance. The large living spaces offer unrivaled views of breathtaking sunrises and sunsets, making them the ideal location for family get-togethers.\n\nIdeally located near Borivali Station, the W.E. Highway, and the soon-to-be Eksar Metro Station, Devidas Lane is a quiet and well-chosen neighborhood of Borivali. The proximity of medical facilities, retail establishments, entertainment venues, and educational institutions also benefits the locals.\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nRishabraj Phoenix brochure\n\n## Pricing of Rishabraj Phoenix\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [3 BHK Apartment](#tabs-7)\n* [4 BHK Apartment](#tabs-9)\n* [5 BHK Apartment](#tabs-11)\n\n* [848 sqft](#tabs-30666)\n* [1274 sqft](#tabs-30667)\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1161 sqft | Price:\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n3 BHK | Carpet Area: 1358 sqft | Price:  ₹ 6.00 Cr\n\n![3 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp)