 Shimpoli Metro Station\n* Borivali Railway Station\n* Gokul Hotel Borivali (W) Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Borivali West**\n\n* Burger King\n* Borivali Biryani Centre ( Chikuwadi ) BBC\n* The Veg Treat II\n* Mexichino restaurant\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Borivali West**\n\n* St. Lawrence High School\n* Swami Vivekanand International School\n* Ryan International School, Kandivali East, Mumbai - CBSE\n* ORCHIDS The International School - Borivali\n* VEDANT INTERNATIONAL TODDLER TECH PRE SCHOOL\n* M.J. Junior College\n* Gokhale Educational Society's\n\n**Hospitals in Borivali West**\n\n* Apex Superspeciality Hospitals - Best Hospital in Borivali\n* Lotus Superspeciality Hospital\n* Sohum Eye Care Centre | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n* Thunga Hospital\n* Phoenix Hospitals PVT.LTD.\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Borivali West**\n\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n* Raghuleela Mega Mall Kandivali West\n* Reliance Mall\n* ZUDIO – Utopia Garden Grove Mall, Borivali\n\n## About H Rishabraj Group\n\n![H Rishabraj Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/9mPKsUSFdvYA1DJ49wHoyhxTjOPInk3lFcitUIOC.png)\n\n* Year Estd. 2009\n* [Projects - 8](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/h-rishabraj-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### H Rishabraj Group\n\nH.Rishabraj Group is one of the leaders in reshaping the residential landscape, known for their outstanding projects and commitment to architectural excellence. Rishabraj\n\nread more\n\nGoregaon is a prime example of their dedication to creating exceptional living spaces that enhance everyday life. With a strong focus on quality, innovation, and customer satisfaction, they’ve built a solid reputation in the real estate industry.\n\nread less\n\n## QR Codes of Rishabraj Phoenix\n\n![P51800033878.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/BkWcQp8Pqj076VwWn0gvi4FlSW0ObqyHUXnuNipQ.webp) P51800033878\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Mon