ed-HOUZDEAL.png)](https://houzdeal.com/)\n\n[Menu Close](https://houzdeal.com/#mobile-menu-toggle)\n\n\n\n# [Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West](https://houzdeal.com/property/rishabraj-phoenix-borivali-west/)\n\nBorivali West\n\n3BHK & Duplex\n\n₹5.70Cr-30Cr\n\nShare to Friends & Family\n\n[![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Untitled-design-77.jpg)](https://houzdeal.com/property/rishabraj-phoenix-borivali-west/ \"Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West\")\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/home-300x300.jpg)\n\nConfiguration: 3BHK & Duplex\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/area-300x300.jpg)\n\nCarpet: 1358-5821 Sq.Ft\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/office-building-300x300.jpg)\n\nTotal Floors: 34\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/architect-300x300.jpg)\n\nReady To Move\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/key-features-300x300.jpg)\n\nPossession: Ready\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/rera-logo.png)\n\nMAHARERA: P51800033878\n\n[Contact Sales](#contact)\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/home-300x300.jpg)\n\nConfiguration: 3BHK & Duplex\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/area-300x300.jpg)\n\nCarpet: 1358-5821 Sq.Ft\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/office-building-300x300.jpg)\n\nTotal Floors: 34\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/architect-300x300.jpg)\n\nReady To Move\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/key-features-300x300.jpg)\n\nPossession: Ready\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/rera-logo.png)\n\nMAHARERA: P51800033878\n\n[Download Brochure](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Ijc0NzAiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D)\n\nBest Deal\n\nZero Brokerage\n\n## About Project\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West nestled in the metropolitan hub of Borivali, lies the 34 storied majestic Rishabraj Phoenix, housing glorious 3 bhk apartments, a unique concept of Jodi flat and magnanimous 6,7 & 9 bedroom duplexes with their own private swimming pool, 31st floor upwards. With each flat enamoured with a breathtaking view of the glitterati of the city beneath it, the intelligently designed balconies of each flat offer pristine, unrestricted views.\n\n[Download Brochure](https://wa.link/bua46y)\n\n## Features\n\n* GYM\n* KIDS AREA\n* CCTV\n* SWIMING POOL\n* INDOOR GAMES\n* RAIN WATER HARVESTING\n* Gated Community\n* Security Systems\n* Lift\n* Roof Top Garden\n* EV Charging Point\n* Sea View\n* Fire Safety System\n* Banquet Hall\n* Vastu Compliant\n* Club House\n\n## Gallery\n\n## Configuration's & Pricing\n\nCONFIGURATION\n\nCARPET AREA\n\nPRICE ₹\n\n3BHK\n\n1358 Sq.Ft\n\n5.70Cr\\*\n\n3BHK\n\n1485 Sq.Ft\n\n6.20Cr\\*\n\nPenthouse\n\n4471 Sq.Ft\n\n23Cr\\*\n\nPenthouse\n\n5321 Sq.Ft\n\n26Cr\\*\n\nPenthouse\n\n5821 Sq.Ft\n\n29Cr\\*\n\n[Get Pricing Details](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Ijc0NDAiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D)\n\n[Prices are subjective, please click here to contact sales](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjM0MjMiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D)\n\n## Floor Plans\n\n[![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Floor-Plan1-768x429.webp)](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Floor-Plan1.webp)\n\n[![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Floor-Plan-2-768x434.webp)](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Floor-Plan-2.webp)\n\n[![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/amenities-plan-768x511.webp)](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/amenities-plan.webp)\n\n[Detailed Floor Plans](#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6Ijc0NDAiLCJ0b2dnbGUiOmZhbHNlfQ%3D%3D)\n\n## About Developer\n\nLoading...\n\n[![H Rishabraj](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/new-logo.png)](https://houzdeal.com/developer/h-rishabraj/ \"H Rishabraj\")\n\n# H Rishabraj\n\n## H Rishabraj, Mr Harrish Kumar Jain is the force behind the Group spearheading into Real Estate space and carving its own niche in Redevelopment Space. He is the son of Mr. Ratanchandji Jain who is a distinguished Businessman and a well-known philanthropist.   Mr Harrish Kumar Jain even before graduating from college begun his entrepreneurial journey in the textile business and after completion of his graduation saw great potential in the Redevelopment of Societies and so his journey began, learning along the way and guided by Family Values of Commitment and Dedication in a short span of a decade he through his companies has managed to develop more than 75+ projects successfully delivering to the delight of existing and new customers.\n\nRead More\n\n## Contact Sales\n\nLoading...\n\n### Enquire About This Property\n\n## Contact Sales\n\n[8806660757](tel:8806660757)\n\nMahaRERA Reg No.: P51800033878 Available at\n\n[https://maharera.mahaonline.gov.in](https://maharera.mahaonline.gov.in/)\n\n![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/RISHABRAJ-PHOENIX-P51800033878_PNG.png)\n\nDisclaimer: The content is for information purposes only and does not constitute an offer to avail of any service. Prices mentioned are subject to change without notice and properties mentioned are subject to availability. Images for representation purpose only. We may share data with rera registered sub brokers/companies/projects for further processing. We may also send updates to the mobile number/email id registered with us. All Rights Reserved.\n\n## Featured Properties\n\n[![Hariko Heritage Borivali East](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Elevation-compares-948x1024.webp)](https://houzdeal.com/property/hariko-heritage-borivali-east/)\n\n# [Hariko Heritage Borivali East](https://houzdeal.com/property/hariko-heritage-borivali-east/)\n\nBorivali East\n\n* 2&3BHK\n\n## Carpet Area- 639-1103 Sq.ft\n\n## Price – ₹On Request\\*\n\n[Get Info.](https://houzdeal.com/property/hariko-heritage-borivali-east/)\n\n[![](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1.jpg)](https://houzdeal.com/property/dgs-sheetal-madhumilan-borivali-west/)\n\n# [DGS Sheetal Madhumilan Borivali West](https://houzdeal.com/property/dgs-sheetal-madhumilan-borivali-west/)\n\nBorivali West\n\n* 2&3BHK\n\n## Carpet Area- 659-1053 Sq.ft\n\n## Price – ₹1.75Cr-2.75Cr\\*\n\n[Get Info.](https://houzdeal.com/property/dgs-sheetal-madhumilan-borivali-west/)\n\n[![DGS Sheetal Sangam Goregaon East](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/ChatGPT-Image-May-25-2026-05_24_03-PM-1024x1024.webp)](https://houzdeal.com/property/dgs-sheetal-sangam-goregaon-east/)\n\n# [DGS Sheetal Sangam Goregaon East](https://houzdeal.com/property/dgs-sheetal-sangam-goregaon-east/)\n\nGoregaon East\n\n* 2BHK\n\n## Carpet Area- 585-710 Sq.ft\n\n## Price – ₹1.85Cr-2.25Cr\\*\n\n[Get Info.](https://houzdeal.com/property/dgs-sheetal-sangam-goregaon-east/)\n\n[![DPS Vista Borivali East](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/elevation-1012x1024.webp)](https://houzdeal.com/property/dps-vista-borivali-east/)\n\n# [DPS Vista Borivali East](https://houzdeal.com/property/dps-vista-borivali-east/)\n\nBorivali East\n\n* 2&3BHK\n\n## Carpet Area- 648-940 Sq.ft\n\n## Price – ₹1.74Cr-2.53Cr\\*\n\n[Get Info.](https://houzdeal.com/property/dps-vista-borivali-east/)\n\n[![Trivikram Residency Borivali West](https://houzdeal.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/elevation.webp)](https://houzdeal.com/property/trivikram-residency-borivali-west/)\n\n# [Trivikram Residency Borivali West](https://houzdeal.com/property/trivikram-residency-borivali-west/)\n\nBorivali West\n\n* 1&2BHK\n\n## Carpet Area- 403-653 Sq.ft\n\n## Price – ₹1.10Cr-2.20Cr\\*\n\n[Get Info.](https://houzdeal.com/property/trivikram-residency-borivali-west/)\n\n[![](https://houzdeal.com/wp