[Project image 9](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287822217-493334900-1280w.webp)![Project image 10](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287822841-640704369-1280w.webp)![Project image 11](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287823465-603201300-1280w.webp)![Project image 12](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287824263-620553211-1280w.webp)![Project image 13](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287824956-983873009-1280w.webp)\n\n# Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West\n\n[By H Rishabraj Group](/builder/h-rishabraj-group)|\n\nLIC Colony, [Borivali West](/in/mumbai/borivali-west)\n\n₹25.00 Cr - 35.00 Cr All inc.\n\n![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West - main project image](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287861597-563685801-1280w.webp)\n\n![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West - image 2](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287815522-12269362-1280w.webp)\n\n![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West - image 3](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287816533-57859326-1280w.webp)\n\n![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West - image 4](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287817378-576688006-1280w.webp)\n\n![Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West - image 5](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/rishabraj-phoenix_1768287818459-613502503-1280w.webp)\n\n8+ more\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Rishabraj Phoenix\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\nWatch This Project Reel\n\nSee highlights of Rishabraj Phoenix\n\n[View Full Reel](/reels)\n\nExplore More Reelsin Borivali West\n\nWatch reels of other projects in the same locality\n\n[Watch All Reels](/reels)\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix Overview\n\n![Land Parcel](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fland-parcel-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n0.61 acres\n\nLand Parcel\n\n![Towers](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-towers-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1\n\nTowers\n\n![Floors](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fnumber-of-floors-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nG+5P+29\n\nFloors\n\n![Config](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fconfig-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n3 BHK, 6, 7 BHK Duplex\n\nConfig\n\n![Carpet Area](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fcarpet-area-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1161-5821 sqft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![RERA NO.](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nP51800033878\n\nRERA NO.\n\n![Possession Status](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nReady To Move\n\nPossession Status\n\n![Target Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nOct 2025\n\nTarget Possession\n\n![RERA Possession](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nFeb 2027\n\nRERA Possession\n\n![Litigation](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nNo\n\nLitigation\n\n### About Rishabraj Phoenix\n\nH Rishabraj Borivali West Project Overview  \nRishabraj Phoenix Project will be constructed on 0.61 Acre of land parcel, 1 tower with G+5P+29 floors having 3 BHK, Duplex, Jodi premium residences .  \n  \nRishabraj Phoenix Location  \nProject is located Near New Link Road, Borivali West, Mumbai with -  \nEksar Metro Station - 750m  \nBorivali West Station - 2.1km  \nDMart - 2.8km  \n  \nRishabraj Phoenix Borivali West Project Amenities  \nFirst is Internal amenities -  \nVitrified Tiles, Granite Platform, SS sink, Branded Fittings, CCTV & many more  \n  \nH Rishabraj Group Borivali West External Amenities  \nProject has 25+ amenities with likes of -  \nGymnasium  \nSwimming Pool  \nKids Pool  \nSenior Citizen Garden  \nYoga & Meditation Deck & many more  \n  \nH Rishabraj Group Phoenix Borivali West Parking -  \nProject has one type of car parking facility -  \n1) Podium  \n  \nRishabraj Phoenix Possession -  \nRera Possession - February 2027  \nTarget Possession - Ready to Move  \n  \nCarpet Area & Floor Plan  \nRishabraj Phoenix Mumbai project has 3BHK, Duplex, Jodi premium residences with -  \n3BHK - (1161 to1485) sqft  \nDuplex - (4471 to 5821) sqft  \nJodi - 2730 sqft  \n  \nRishabraj Phoenix floor plan  \nRishabraj Phoenix floor plan will have 4 flats, 9 lifts & 2 staircases on each floor  \n  \nPhoenix Borivali West sample flat is ready to view at the site.  \n  \nRishabraj Phoenix Mumbai Prices & its details can be found in the price section & Rishabraj Phoenix Borivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentioned below. Project has been praised by the home buyers & H Rishabraj Group Borivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix Location\n\nNear New Link Rd, LIC Colony, Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n* Eksar Metro Station - 750m\n* Borivali West Station - 2.1km\n* DMart - 2.8km\n\n![360 background](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&w=1280&q=75)\n\n![Housiey Logo](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&w=256&q=75)\n\n![360](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&w=128&q=75)\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix Videos\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix Pros & Cons\n\n![Pros-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nPros\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.The project is located in a prime area with excellent connectivity to Eksar Metro Station, New Link Road, D-Mart, and other key conveniences.\n\n2.With large carpet areas, especially in the 3BHK units, the project caters to buyers seeking more space—something that's becoming uncommon in the current market trend.\n\n3.With large balcony areas rarely found in current developments, this project stands out as a great choice for buyers who value outdoor living.\n\n![Cons-icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\nCons\n\n![toggle-arrow](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&w=64&q=75)\n\n1.Unoptimized Unit Plan – The 3BHK apartments across all carpet areas have inefficient layouts, with excessive passage space that does not contribute to usable living areas.\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix Amenities\n\n### Internal Amenities\n\n![Intercom Facility](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652439390316-img.webp)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![Vitrified Tiles](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp)\n\nVitrified Tiles\n\n![Granite Kitchen Platform](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/granite-kitchen-platform_External_1770712604025-330259421.webp)\n\nGranite Kitchen Platform\n\n![Stainless Steel Sink](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1646987626444-img.webp)\n\nStainless Steel Sink\n\n![Fire Fighting](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/fire-fighting_External_1770712237914-35127023.webp)\n\nFire Fighting\n\n### External Amenities\n\n![Swimming Pool](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652447054692-img.webp)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![Kids Play Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446278292-img.webp)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/jogging-track_External_1770724897454-7779386.webp)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![Multi Purpose Court](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652446516876-img.webp)\n\nMulti Purpose Court\n\n![Senior Citizen Area](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/