icon](/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpdf-icon.png&w=64&q=75)\n\nRishabraj Phoenix Layout Plan\n\nNote: You can download more detailed documents by following this [link](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/36451)\n\n## Rishabraj Phoenix QR Codes\n\n[![RERA QR code - P51800033878](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/RERA-QR-images/rera_qr_code_1742558214495-512466692.webp)\n\nP51800033878](https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/36451)\n\n## Project approved by\n\n## About H Rishabraj Group\n\nH Rishabraj Group\n\n![H Rishabraj Group](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/builders/loogo--1717748689431-img.webp)\n\n2 CitiesLocations\n\nMumbai CityMumbai suburban\n\n12 yearsExperience\n\n50Total Projects\n\n5K+Happy Families\n\nWe consistently deliver projects ahead of schedule, surpassing expectations and actively contributing to our vision of “Energizing Happiness”.\n\n## Frequently Asked Question\n\nYes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 3BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\n\nThe expected possession date is **01 February 2027** as per RERA. Construction is currently **100%** complete as of April 21, 2026. Target possession is **01 October 2025**.\n\nYes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is **P51800033878**.  \nYou can verify it on the official RERA portal: <https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/36451>\n\nNo, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\n\nThe following legal documents are available on Housiey: **Commencement Certificate**, **Legal Title Report**, **Layout Plan**, **Proforma Allotment Letter**. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number **P51800033878**.\n\nThis project offers **19+** amenities. Key external amenities include Gymnasium, Yoga Deck, Indoor games, Jacuzzi, and Gazebo.  \n Internal specifications include Fire Fighting and Stainless Steel Sink. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\n\nMonthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\n\nIn Rishabraj Phoenix, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **1161 sq. ft.**  \n• **1358 sq. ft.**  \n• **1485 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Rishabraj Phoenix, the 6BHK Duplex units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **5821 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Rishabraj Phoenix, the 7BHK Duplex units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **4471 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nIn Rishabraj Phoenix, the (3+3)BHK Jodi units are available in the following carpet area options:  \n• **2730 sq. ft.**  \nEach configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in Rishabraj Phoenix starts from **₹5.20 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **1161 sq. ft.** – ₹5.20 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **1358 sq. ft.** – ₹5.76 Cr (all-inclusive)  \n• **1485 sq. ft.** – ₹6.00 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 6BHK Duplex in Rishabraj Phoenix starts from **₹35.00 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **5821 sq. ft.** – ₹35.00 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a 7BHK Duplex in Rishabraj Phoenix starts from **₹25.00 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **4471 sq. ft.** – ₹25.00 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nThe all-inclusive price of a (3+3)BHK Jodi in Rishabraj Phoenix starts from **₹12.00 Cr** and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.   \n• **2730 sq. ft.** – ₹12.00 Cr (all-inclusive)  \nThe price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\n\nIt is built across **0.61 acres** with **1** towers with **G+5P+29** floors. Each floor has **4** flats per floor, **9** lifts, **2** staircases. It is available in **3BHK/6BHK Duplex/7BHK Duplex/(3+3)BHK Jodi** configurations with carpet areas ranging from **1161** to **5821 sq. ft.**\n\nRishabraj Phoenix provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the Rishabraj Phoenix project page on Housiey.\n\nIt is located at **Near New Link Rd, LIC Colony, Borivali West, Mumbai**.  \nNearby landmarks include:  \n**• Eksar Metro Station - 750m**   \n**• Borivali West Station - 2.1km**   \n**• DMart - 2.8km**\n\nThe following payment plans are available:  \n• **CLP ( Construction Link plan)** - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%  \n  \n**Note:** In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\n\nThe minimum down payment starts from **₹78.00 Lacs**, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\n\nYes, it is approved by leading banks including **Central Bank of India**, **Union Bank of India**, **Bank Of India**, **Bank Of Baroda**, **Citi Bank**, **Kotak Mahindra Bank**, **Axis Bank**, **State Bank Of India**, **ICICI Bank**, **HDFC BANK**. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\n\nNo - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\n\nIt is developed by **H Rishabraj Group**, a trusted real estate brand with over **12 years** of experience and more than **50 completed projects** across **Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban**.  \n**Some of their notable developments include:**  \n  \n • **Rishabraj Arham** in Goregaon West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Rishabraj Anuja** in Borivali West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Rishabraj Ceramont** in Malad West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **H. Rishabraj Trident** in Andheri West, Mumbai  \n  \n • **Rishabraj Emerald** in Dahisar East, Mumbai\n\nYes, the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey. You can download them from the Documents section or verify them on the RERA portal.\n\nYes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.  \n  \nAlternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\n\nYes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\n\n**Borivali West** is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.  \n  \nThis project by **H Rishabraj Group** - with 12 years of experience - offers 3BHK/6BHK Duplex/7BHK Duplex/(3+3)BHK Jodi at ₹5.20 Cr to ₹35.00 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\n\nBuying through Housiey gives you:  \n(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price  \n(2) Free Ola cab site visit  \n(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home  \n(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal  \n(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project  \nAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\n\nThe price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \"Price Sheet\" or \"Brochure\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\n\nHousiey has a **4.8 rating** on Google with **2,395+ reviews**.  \n  \nOver **8,500 families** have purchased homes through Housiey across **8+ cities** with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted **1.2 lakh+ free site visits** and facilitated over **₹8,000 crore** worth of property transactions.\n\n## Explore Related Projects\n\n![DSD Aura](https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/project_images/DSD_Aura_Elevation--1694329813038-img-1280w.webp)\n\n[### DSD Aura](/projects/dsd-aura)\n\n₹ 4.70 Cr (All inc)\n\n[DSD Group](/builder/dsd-group)\n\n890- 1941sqft\n\nBorivali West\n\nReady\n\n3BHKLimited\n\n